            <svg class="ws-landing-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
            <h2 class="ws-landing-card-title">Sponsorships</h2>
            <p class="ws-landing-card-desc">Sponsor directory, placements, invoice status.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ws-landing-card ws-landing-card--disabled">
            <svg class="ws-landing-card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>
            <h2 class="ws-landing-card-title">Flows</h2>
            <p class="ws-landing-card-desc">Automated workflows and content pipelines.</p>
